		<item>
		<title>The LEGOLAND Christmas Holiday Bricktacular Event 2026 is Here (California, Florida &#038; New York)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/the-legoland-christmas-holiday-bricktacular-event-2026-is-here-california-florida-new-york/</link>
