										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em>This article was written by News Reporter.</em></p>
<p>With the holiday season almost here, LEGOLAND resorts across the USA are transforming into winter and Christmas-themed destinations with a variety of exciting, cheerful, and festive things to do, see, and enjoy.</p>
<p>Let&#8217;s break down what this year&#8217;s Christmas Holiday Bricktacular event looks like at <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a>, <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a>, and <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F">LEGOLAND New York</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-105262 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign.jpg" alt="" width="1364" height="893" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign.jpg 1364w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign-300x196.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign-1024x670.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign-768x503.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1364px) 100vw, 1364px" /></a></p>
<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li>The LEGOLAND Christmas Holiday Bricktacular event runs on select dates from November 21st to January 3rd at <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> and <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a>, and from November 27th to January 2nd at <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F">LEGOLAND New York</a>.</li>
<li><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> has fireworks on select dates, while <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a> offers drone shows instead.</li>
<li>The Christmas Holiday Bricktacular events at each LEGOLAND resort are full of holiday-themed shows, activities, and treats.</li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>LEGOLAND California Resort</h2>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-115002" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-christmas-key-visual-california-1920x1280-1.jpg" alt="" width="840" height="560" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-christmas-key-visual-california-1920x1280-1.jpg 840w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-christmas-key-visual-california-1920x1280-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-christmas-key-visual-california-1920x1280-1-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px" /></a></p>
<p>At <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a>, Christmas Bricktacular runs on select dates from November 21st to January 3rd. Visitors can enjoy fireworks on December 5th and December 12th, as well as every day from December 19th to the 31st.</p>
<p>In addition to the fireworks, you can also watch a variety of shows, meet and take photos with some of your favorite LEGO characters, and enjoy limited-time sweets and treats. The resort also includes some new activities this year, including:</p>
<ul>
<li>Reindeer Refuel, a festive reindeer barn where families can feed LEGO reindeer.</li>
<li>An Elf Choir, where children can join the choir at a colorful LEGO music machine.</li>
<li>The Gingerbread Station, which is an interactive experience where kids follow prompts to prepare a festive recipe.</li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>LEGOLAND Florida Resort</h2>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-115001" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gingerbread-kitchen.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gingerbread-kitchen.jpg 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gingerbread-kitchen-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gingerbread-kitchen-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gingerbread-kitchen-768x768.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida&#8217;s</a> Christmas Bricktacular event also runs on select dates from November 21st to January 3rd. While <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> offers fireworks, <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a> is debuting a festive drone show, which runs on December 5th, 6th, 12th, 13th, and every day from the 19th to the 30th.</p>
<p>Of course, there are many other things to enjoy as part of this event, such as meeting iconic LEGO characters, partaking in a Holiday Traditions Scavenger Hunt, and trying a variety of limited-time treats.</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114553 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Holiday-Christmas-Drone-Show-Bricktacular-Theme-Park.jpg" alt="" width="666" height="625" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Holiday-Christmas-Drone-Show-Bricktacular-Theme-Park.jpg 666w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Holiday-Christmas-Drone-Show-Bricktacular-Theme-Park-300x282.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 666px) 100vw, 666px" /></a></p>
<p>Some new activities for this year include Reindeer Refuel, the resort&#8217;s first-ever rap battle show, an all-new interactive light trail called Light Up LEGOLAND, and several other interactive and holiday-themed experiences.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>LEGOLAND New York Resort</h2>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-115000" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/experience-glice-skating-holidays.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/experience-glice-skating-holidays.jpg 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/experience-glice-skating-holidays-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/experience-glice-skating-holidays-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/experience-glice-skating-holidays-768x768.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<p>Unlike the other two resorts, <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> runs its Holiday Bricktacular event from November 27th to January 2nd. The New York resort also doesn&#8217;t offer fireworks or a drone show. However, there&#8217;s still plenty to do, such as watching holiday-themed shows, enjoying meet-and-greets, going ice skating, and so much more.</p>
<p>No matter which LEGOLAND resort you visit, the Christmas Holiday Bricktacular is sure to get you in the holiday spirit!</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114977 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="887" height="885" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo.jpg 887w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-768x766.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px" /></a></p>
<p><em>If you don&#8217;t want to stay at the LEGOLAND hotels, there are other hotels near LEGOLAND as well &#8211; <b>Book Other Hotels &amp; Vacation Rentals Outside of LEGOLAND: </b></em><a href="https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-5112601-15734399" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Hotels.com</a> | <a href="https://vrbo.stay22.com/toysnbricks/tbod3hLoQ8" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">VRBO</a></p>
