					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="2207" height="2560" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-scaled.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Speed Champions March 2027 Sets Front Box 77277 77276 77275 77274 77273 77272 77271 77270 77269 77268 77267" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-scaled.jpg 2207w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-259x300.jpg 259w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-883x1024.jpg 883w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-768x891.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-1324x1536.jpg 1324w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-1766x2048.jpg 1766w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-1024x1188.jpg 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2207px) 100vw, 2207px" /></p>
<p>Eleven LEGO Speed Champions March 2026 Spring sets have been revealed LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). We&#8217;ll look at the release</p>
