										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Eleven LEGO Speed Champions March 2026 Spring sets have been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). We&#8217;ll look at the release dates, US/Canada prices, set images and more in this article!</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when these LEGO Speed Champions March 2027 sets becomes available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-115109 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-scaled.jpg" alt="" width="913" height="1059" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-scaled.jpg 2207w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-259x300.jpg 259w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-883x1024.jpg 883w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-768x891.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-1324x1536.jpg 1324w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-1766x2048.jpg 1766w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-March-2027-Sets-Front-Box-77277-77276-77275-77274-77273-77272-77271-77270-77269-77268-77267-1024x1188.jpg 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 913px) 100vw, 913px" /></p>
