oding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-115075 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-115076 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Back-Box.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="663" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Back-Box.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x166.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x566.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77267-Ferrari-SF-26-F1-Race-Car-March-2027-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x424.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>*Additional details including product descriptions regarding these sets can be found on the official LEGO site (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are <span style="text-decoration: underline;">no ads</span> in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
