		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114998</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="773" height="885" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-3.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Amazon Canada LEGO Early Black Friday November 2026 Deals &amp; Sales List 3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-3.jpg 773w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-3-262x300.jpg 262w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-3-768x879.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 773px) 100vw, 773px" /></p>
<p>Good Wednesday Late Afternoon Canadian LEGO Fans! Amazon Canada has now launched their LEGO Early Black Friday 2026</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/amazon-canada-lego-early-black-friday-2026-deals-sales-now-live-over-200-sets-discounted/">Amazon Canada LEGO Early Black Friday 2026 Deals &#038; Sales Now Live: Over 200 Sets Discounted</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/deals?pd_rd_w=CV5VA&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_p=01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_r=QE08CKS8B6EC26Q3P1FB&amp;pd_rd_wg=egV47&amp;pd_rd_r=51e198eb-512e-4c5d-8a09-14d2b64b1ce4&amp;bubble-id=toys-games&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=8cd12d6033884e2f94f786ad0a5724b5&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115007 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-3.jpg" alt="" width="773" height="885" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-3.jpg 773w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-3-262x300.jpg 262w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-3-768x879.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 773px) 100vw, 773px" /></a></p>
<p>Good Wednesday Late Afternoon Canadian LEGO Fans! <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> has now launched their <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/deals?pd_rd_w=CV5VA&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_p=01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_r=QE08CKS8B6EC26Q3P1FB&amp;pd_rd_wg=egV47&amp;pd_rd_r=51e198eb-512e-4c5d-8a09-14d2b64b1ce4&amp;bubble-id=toys-games&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=68235b3f91cc377ec2fd6ecef23ae089&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Early Black Friday 2026 Deals &amp; Sales</a>! Black Friday is actually next week on Friday, November 27, 2026. But it seems like they now call it &#8220;Black Friday Week&#8221; so the deals are now live already.</p>
<p>There are deals in every department and not just LEGO. Feel free to check out all the Black Friday Week 2026 savings <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/blackfriday?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=4cba3bdbf7e130e22b845b636870c50f&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a>. Prime Membership is <span style="text-decoration: underline;">not required</span> to purchase these sets with Black Friday savings.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/deals?pd_rd_w=CV5VA&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_p=01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_r=QE08CKS8B6EC26Q3P1FB&amp;pd_rd_wg=egV47&amp;pd_rd_r=51e198eb-512e-4c5d-8a09-14d2b64b1ce4&amp;bubble-id=toys-games&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=68235b3f91cc377ec2fd6ecef23ae089&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115004 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List.jpg" alt="" width="637" height="885" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List.jpg 637w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-216x300.jpg 216w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 637px) 100vw, 637px" /></a></p>
<p>Over 200 LEGO sets are discounted at various saving percentages. There are two LEGO Black Friday 2026 lists and you can check them out <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?k=lego&amp;rh=p_n_deal_type%3A23565506011%2Cp_6%3AA3DWYIK6Y9EEQB&amp;dc=&amp;ds=v1%3A1GBiYu09QD1PWWT%2BxlsUX81EZF7SVjqA%2BKxo5J4MXD4&amp;crid=1BL5A9WU8K1JZ&amp;qid=1795045921&amp;rnid=12035754011&amp;sprefix=le%2Caps%2C300&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=442114232aeba8d9bb621b8b91192a1f&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a> and <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/deals?pd_rd_w=CV5VA&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_p=01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_r=QE08CKS8B6EC26Q3P1FB&amp;pd_rd_wg=egV47&amp;pd_rd_r=51e198eb-512e-4c5d-8a09-14d2b64b1ce4&amp;bubble-id=toys-games&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=68235b3f91cc377ec2fd6ecef23ae089&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a>. Free shipping on orders above $35 CAD.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/deals?pd_rd_w=CV5VA&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_p=01d614e6-829b-4a2e-9483-82616314febb&amp;pf_rd_r=QE08CKS8B6EC26Q3P1FB&amp;pd_rd_wg=egV47&amp;pd_rd_r=51e198eb-512e-4c5d-8a09-14d2b64b1ce4&amp;bubble-id=toys-games&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=68235b3f91cc377ec2fd6ecef23ae089&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115006 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-2.jpg" alt="" width="634" height="885" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-2.jpg 634w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-November-2026-Deals-Sales-List-2-215x300.jpg 215w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 634px) 100vw, 634px" /></a></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>For the Amazon LEGO 2026 Deals, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/4dYMzLn" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/40WwLo0">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3TkFHyh" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3V3vjwl">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/4jKQPPG" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3Ofv2CG">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>For Amazon LEGO Bestsellers List, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></p>
